\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Thirty-two of the 594 annotated floor plans}, truth filled, estimate outlined, with the achieved IoU beneath each. The panels are ordered by IoU and sampled evenly across the corpus, so the population's \emph  {worst} room is at the left of the top row and the sample is not a selection of successes. The shapes are the corpus's own: between \num {6} and \num {22} corners, with alcoves, wall columns and re-entrant corners that no rectangle prior would admit.}}{4}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mosaic}{{2}{4}{\textbf {Thirty-two of the 594 annotated floor plans}, truth filled, estimate outlined, with the achieved IoU beneath each. The panels are ordered by IoU and sampled evenly across the corpus, so the population's \emph {worst} room is at the left of the top row and the sample is not a selection of successes. The shapes are the corpus's own: between \num {6} and \num {22} corners, with alcoves, wall columns and re-entrant corners that no rectangle prior would admit}{figure.2}{}}
